<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">EDUCATION / INVEST IN YOURSELF</div><h1>Think beyond today.</h1><p>Choose a path. Study while you are offline. Collect a permanent advantage.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/city">Overview →</a></div>
<div id="educationMsg" class="game-feedback" role="status" hidden></div>
<% const active = courses.find(c => c.completed_at === null); const completed = courses.filter(c => c.completed_at !== null).map(c => c.course_key); %>
<section class="dashboard-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Your advantages</h2><span class="small-badge"><%= completed.length %> / <%= COURSES.length %> COMPLETE</span></div><div class="perk-grid"><span>Catch risk <b>−<%= user.perks.crimeRisk %> points</b></span><span>Crime cash <b>+<%= user.perks.crimeCash %>%</b></span><span>Gym gains <b>+<%= user.perks.training %>%</b></span><span>Combat damage <b>+<%= user.perks.damage %>%</b></span><span>Damage taken <b>−<%= user.perks.protection %>%</b></span></div><p class="panel-intro">One course at a time. Pay once from cash on hand; no energy or nerve is needed. The perk activates when you collect the completed course. There is no time limit to collect.</p></section>
<div class="course-grid">
<% COURSES.forEach(course => { const row=courses.find(c=>c.course_key===course.key); const done=completed.includes(course.key); const studying=row && !done; const locked=course.requires && !completed.includes(course.requires); const prerequisite=COURSES.find(c=>c.key===course.requires); %>
<article class="dashboard-panel course-card"><div class="panel-heading"><span class="eyebrow"><%= course.track %></span><span class="small-badge"><%= done ? 'COMPLETED ✓' : studying ? 'IN PROGRESS' : locked ? 'LOCKED' : 'AVAILABLE' %></span></div><h2><%= course.name %></h2><p><%= course.desc %></p><div class="course-cost"><strong>$<%= course.cost.toLocaleString() %></strong><span><%= course.duration / 60 %> minutes · permanent perk</span></div>
<% if (studying) { %><p class="course-timer" data-finishes="<%= row.finishes_at %>">Study in progress…</p><button class="action-button" data-course="<%= course.key %>" data-action="complete" <%= row.finishes_at>now ? 'disabled' : '' %>>Collect perk</button>
<% } else if (done) { %><p class="subtle">Your perk is active across every city.</p>
<% } else { %><p class="subtle"><%= locked ? `Requires ${prerequisite.name}.` : active ? 'Finish and collect your current course first.' : user.cash < course.cost ? 'Earn more cash to enroll.' : 'Ready when you are.' %></p><button class="action-button" data-course="<%= course.key %>" data-action="start" <%= locked || active || user.cash<course.cost || user.in_jail || user.in_hospital ? 'disabled' : '' %>>Enroll →</button><% } %>
</article><% }); %>
</div>
<script src="/js/education.js" defer></script>
